@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### List environments
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/2/environments

### Create an environment (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/2/environments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "qa" }

### Regenerate a key (use a real environment id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/2/environments/3/api-key/regenerate

### Delete an environment (use a real environment id)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/2/environments/5